1
00:00:00,540 --> 00:00:01,940
真庆幸我们来了
I just love that we're here.

2
00:00:02,040 --> 00:00:03,780
有什么比发展中国家获得清洁水资源
Is there anything more important than clean water

3
00:00:03,780 --> 00:00:04,720
更重要的吗
in developing countries?

4
00:00:04,720 --> 00:00:06,774
或者比一个干净的高脚杯更重要
Or a clean glass in this one?

5
00:00:07,371 --> 00:00:10,357
是安妮·吉布斯 12频道的新闻女主播
It that Anne Gibbs, the lady from Channel 12 News?

6
00:00:10,357 --> 00:00:12,856
天呐 那是安妮·吉布斯 我超爱她
Oh, my God! It's Anne Gibbs! Oh, I love her!

7
00:00:12,856 --> 00:00:13,646
那要是安妮·海瑟薇
That reaction would've

8
00:00:13,646 --> 00:00:14,840
这反应也太夸张了
been big if it was Anne Hathaway.

9
00:00:14,840 --> 00:00:16,700
她坐在主播台后完全看不出身材这么好呢
Oh, she is hiding quite a figure behind that desk.

10
00:00:16,700 --> 00:00:17,928
你跟安妮·吉布斯什么情况
Okay, what's going on with you and Anne Gibbs?

11
00:00:17,928 --> 00:00:18,981
来吧 去跟她打个招呼
Come on. We gotta go say hi to her.

12
00:00:18,981 --> 00:00:20,277
好吧 走吧
Okay, we're doing this.

13
00:00:23,220 --> 00:00:23,960
抱歉打扰
I'm sorry.

14
00:00:24,640 --> 00:00:25,640
我是你的粉丝
I am such a fan.

15
00:00:25,700 --> 00:00:27,260
你做的那个驼背体操运动员的报道
I was so moved by that story you did

16
00:00:27,260 --> 00:00:28,360
让我非常感动
about the gymnast with the hump.

17
00:00:28,360 --> 00:00:29,540
-你知道不可思议的是什么吗 -什么
- You wanna hear something crazy? - Yeah.

18
00:00:29,540 --> 00:00:31,380
他刚获得了圣母大学的奖学金
He just got a scholarship to Notre Dame.

19
00:00:31,500 --> 00:00:33,700
不是吧 天呐
No! Oh, my gosh!

20
00:00:34,020 --> 00:00:35,320
你可能经常听说这些事
You probably get this all the time,

21
00:00:35,320 --> 00:00:36,920
但我也想跟你说个故事
but I have a story for you.

22
00:00:37,120 --> 00:00:38,480
我代表一些无家可归的人士
I represent some homeless people

23
00:00:38,480 --> 00:00:41,400
起诉一家剥削员工薪金的公司
in a case against a corporation that pays them slave wages.

24
00:00:41,400 --> 00:00:42,160
-有意思 -是啊
- Interesting. - Yes.

25
00:00:42,160 --> 00:00:43,440
这事有多长时间了
How long has this been going on?

26
00:00:43,460 --> 00:00:44,580
从2012年开始的
Since 2012.

27
00:00:44,680 --> 00:00:45,760
我们想让社会知道
We're just trying to shine a light

28
00:00:45,760 --> 00:00:47,120
他们的处境有多糟
on how awful they're being.

29
00:00:47,200 --> 00:00:47,660
非常糟糕
Truly awful.

30
00:00:47,720 --> 00:00:48,720
你也在做这个吗
Are you working on this, too?

31
00:00:48,800 --> 00:00:49,640
没有没有
Oh, gosh. No, no.

32
00:00:49,640 --> 00:00:50,540
我是他的老公
I'm just this one's husband.

33
00:00:51,080 --> 00:00:52,260
我是高中橄榄球队教练
I'm a high school football coach.

34
00:00:52,320 --> 00:00:52,920
我叫卡梅隆·塔克
Cameron Tucker.

35
00:00:52,920 --> 00:00:54,260
没错 老天 我好傻
Yes. Oh, god. I'm so embarrassed.

36
00:00:54,260 --> 00:00:55,400
我叫米奇尔·普里契特 你好吗
Mitchell Pritchett. How are you?

37
00:00:55,400 --> 00:00:56,380
-真的吗 -那么
- Really? - So --

38
00:00:56,380 --> 00:00:59,400
你是个出柜的高中橄榄球教练吗
You are an openly gay high school football coach?

39
00:00:59,400 --> 00:01:01,420
我懂我懂 你一听到橄榄球教练
I know, I know. You hear "football coach,"

40
00:01:01,420 --> 00:01:02,540
就以为我会是
and you expect to meet somebody

41
00:01:02,540 --> 00:01:03,940
像约翰·韦恩那样的硬汉吧[大喊"约翰·韦恩"]
that screams John Wayne.

42
00:01:04,180 --> 00:01:06,040
但其实我唯一一次大喊"公爵"[约翰·韦恩的绰号]
Meanwhile, the only time I've screamed the duke

43
00:01:06,040 --> 00:01:08,380
是那次我们争论《唐顿庄园》里谁最帅
is when we argue over who's the cutest on "Downton Abbey."

44
00:01:09,860 --> 00:01:11,760
可怜的米奇尔 他听我喊了一百遍
Poor Mitchell. He's had to hear that a hundred times.

45
00:01:11,760 --> 00:01:12,600
没错 没错
I have. I have.

46
00:01:12,660 --> 00:01:14,480
那些流浪人员的时薪只有一美元
So these homeless people are making a dollar an hour --

47
00:01:14,480 --> 00:01:16,400
现在出柜的橄榄球教练多吗
Are there a lot of openly gay coaches?

48
00:01:16,400 --> 00:01:18,692
如果成人电影可信
Oh, if the adult film industry's to be believed,

49
00:01:18,692 --> 00:01:20,100
那就到处都是
there all are.

50
00:01:21,507 --> 00:01:22,181
这样做
It's in, you know,

51
00:01:22,181 --> 00:01:24,352
明显违反了《联邦公平劳动标准法案》
clear violations Of the federal fair labor standards act --

52
00:01:24,352 --> 00:01:27,720
有人联系你做新闻报道吗
Has anyone ever approached you for a news segment?

53
00:01:27,720 --> 00:01:29,460
报道我吗 老天 没有 我觉得
On me?! Oh, my Gosh. No. I don't...

54
00:01:29,520 --> 00:01:31,220
我觉得我的故事不足以做成
I don't think I'm interesting enough

55
00:01:31,220 --> 00:01:32,360
一篇有意思的新闻报道
to do a news segment on.

56
00:01:32,420 --> 00:01:34,360
记者要拿我说什么啊
I mean, what would a reporter even say about me?

57
00:01:34,360 --> 00:01:36,840
说我是个拥有不败战绩
That I'm a high school football coach

58
00:01:36,840 --> 00:01:39,200
勇于打破陈规的高中橄榄球教练吗
with an undefeated record who's tackling stereotypes?

59
00:01:39,740 --> 00:01:42,880
说我带的队禁止偏见
That on my team, prejudice is considered out of bounds?

60
00:01:43,000 --> 00:01:45,280
说我们突破偏执 摒弃狭隘
That we're blitzing bigotry, kicking intolerance,

61
00:01:45,280 --> 00:01:46,740
-坚持不懈地... -使用比喻
- and beating... - metaphors to death?

62
00:02:01,545 --> 00:02:03,760
你们想看点超酷的东西吗
You guys wanna see something really cool?

63
00:02:03,760 --> 00:02:04,700
藏在那艘古老的船后面了吗
Is it behind that old boat?

64
00:02:04,800 --> 00:02:07,300
这是有史以来最著名的战舰之一
This is one of the most famous warships of all time.

65
00:02:07,300 --> 00:02:09,660
宪法号
The "U.S.S. Constitution."

66
00:02:09,660 --> 00:02:11,280
服役84年
Stayed in active duty 84 years.

67
00:02:11,560 --> 00:02:13,540
没有任何敌人成功登上这艘战舰
No enemy managed to board her.

68
00:02:14,209 --> 00:02:16,436
才10秒 这船已经让我觉得无聊了
10 seconds, she's already bored me.

69
00:02:17,220 --> 00:02:18,620
你的西语老师来了
That's your Spanish tutor.

70
00:02:18,620 --> 00:02:20,220
我要再说一次
I'm gonna say it one more time.

71
00:02:20,220 --> 00:02:22,040
我真的觉得法语更适合我
I really think French will be a better fit for me.

72
00:02:22,200 --> 00:02:22,840
你的名字叫
Your name is

73
00:02:22,840 --> 00:02:24,660
曼尼尔·阿尔伯特·哈维尔·亚历杭德罗·迪尔加多
Manuel Alberto Javier Alejandro Delgado.

74
00:02:25,160 --> 00:02:26,520
法语怎么会更适合你
How is French a better fit for you?

75
00:02:26,620 --> 00:02:27,340
我敢肯定
Okay, I'm pretty sure

76
00:02:27,340 --> 00:02:29,400
你又加了个我从没听过的中间名
you threw in a name I've never heard before.

77
00:02:30,840 --> 00:02:31,240
你好
Hello.

78
00:02:31,240 --> 00:02:33,513
请说西语哦
AH, AH! En Espagnol, por favor.

79
00:02:33,513 --> 00:02:35,860
行了 别要求这么高
Okay, let's take it down a nacho.

80
00:02:35,860 --> 00:02:36,480
你好啊 迪亚高
Hola, Diego!

81
00:02:40,300 --> 00:02:41,220
您一定是普里契特先生吧
You must be Mr. Pritchett.

82
00:02:41,300 --> 00:02:42,820
叫我杰吧 很高兴你能来
Jay. And I'm just glad you're here.

83
00:02:42,900 --> 00:02:44,080
歌洛莉亚试图教曼尼学西语
Gloria tried to tutor Manny.

84
00:02:44,080 --> 00:02:45,920
《海伦·凯勒》那部电影里都没那么多叫喊场面
There was less yelling in "The Miracle Worker."

85
00:02:45,920 --> 00:02:47,700
因为他连学都不学
Because he wasn't even trying.

86
00:02:48,120 --> 00:02:49,640
抱歉 但对我来说
I'm sorry, but Spanish

87
00:02:49,640 --> 00:02:51,180
西语听起来不太自然
just doesn't seem natural to me.

88
00:02:51,660 --> 00:02:53,160
我不喜欢西语的发音方式
I don't like the way it hits my ear.

89
00:02:53,260 --> 00:02:56,920
有什么能比你的母语听起来更自然的
What could be more natural than your mother's tongue in your ear?

90
00:02:56,930 --> 00:02:59,168
你认不认识什么不错的英语老师
Do you happen to know a good English tutor?

91
00:03:00,560 --> 00:03:01,480
亲爱的
Hey, honey!

92
00:03:02,512 --> 00:03:03,960
还在准备考试吗
Still studying for that test?

93
00:03:03,960 --> 00:03:05,440
不行 我要学习
I can't. I have to study.

94
00:03:05,740 --> 00:03:06,720
你几点睡的
What time did you get to bed?

95
00:03:07,160 --> 00:03:07,880
当然了
Sure thing.

96
00:03:10,120 --> 00:03:12,460
克莱尔 我觉得艾丽克斯不太对劲
Claire, I think something's up with Alex.

97
00:03:13,120 --> 00:03:14,480
不知道 某种鸡
I don't know. Some kind of chicken.

98
00:03:14,480 --> 00:03:16,460
为什么没人听我说
Why is no one listening to me?

99
00:03:16,960 --> 00:03:17,340
过来
Come here.

100
00:03:18,240 --> 00:03:19,620
我觉得她睡眠不足
I don't think she's getting enough sleep.

101
00:03:20,400 --> 00:03:22,360
你看她 简直像个自动吸尘器
Look at her. She's like a human roomba.

102
00:03:24,440 --> 00:03:25,400
艾丽克斯没事
Alex will be fine.

103
00:03:26,380 --> 00:03:27,480
这才是大问题
This is our real problem.

104
00:03:27,820 --> 00:03:29,000
我今早去上班的时候
When I left for work this morning,

105
00:03:29,160 --> 00:03:30,920
她就坐在沙发上翻杂志
she was sitting on the couch, flipping through magazines.

106
00:03:31,080 --> 00:03:32,720
她20岁了 她在寻找自我
She's 20. She's finding herself.

107
00:03:32,860 --> 00:03:34,420
那有多难啊 她连动都没动
How hard can it be? She hasn't moved.

108
00:03:34,420 --> 00:03:36,100
那你20岁的时候在干什么
Well, what were you doing at 20?

109
00:03:36,100 --> 00:03:36,480
我吗
Me?

110
00:03:36,840 --> 00:03:38,980
我大学绩点4.0
I was getting a 4.0 in college.

111
00:03:39,020 --> 00:03:41,340
我每周工作25小时
I was working 25 hours a week.

112
00:03:41,340 --> 00:03:43,660
我在一个自杀热线当志愿者
I was volunteering at a suicide hotline.

113
00:03:43,660 --> 00:03:45,680
别坐在沙发上了
Get off the couch!

114
00:03:45,900 --> 00:03:46,820
做点什么改变你的生命吧
Do something with your life!

115
00:03:46,980 --> 00:03:48,760
那是协助自杀热线吗
Was it an assisted suicide hotline?

116
00:03:50,020 --> 00:03:51,660
你父亲回来了
Your father's home...

117
00:03:51,660 --> 00:03:52,880
刚工作完
from work.

118
00:03:53,920 --> 00:03:55,700
已经回来了吗 一定很棒
Already? Must be nice.

119
00:03:59,739 --> 00:04:01,997
二爸 我的娃娃哭个不停
Daddy, my doll won't stop crying.

120
00:04:01,997 --> 00:04:03,660
亲爱的 你试过关机吗
Oh, honey, did you try the "Off" switch?

121
00:04:03,660 --> 00:04:05,140
我当然试过了
Of course I tried the "Off" switch!

122
00:04:05,360 --> 00:04:05,680
莉莉
Lily!

123
00:04:06,020 --> 00:04:06,960
抱歉我冲你吼了
Sorry I snapped.

124
00:04:06,960 --> 00:04:09,082
但她已经哭了一整天了
She's been like this all d.

125
00:04:10,880 --> 00:04:11,720
给你
There you go.

126
00:04:11,800 --> 00:04:12,820
这招对你从不管用
That never worked on you.

127
00:04:14,140 --> 00:04:14,880
好消息
So, good news.

128
00:04:14,940 --> 00:04:18,020
安妮·吉布斯想要对我进行一个专题采访
Anne Gibbs actually wants to do a news segment on me!

129
00:04:18,260 --> 00:04:18,700
什么
What?!

130
00:04:19,475 --> 00:04:21,400
真是好消息 小卡
Great news, Cam.

131
00:04:21,400 --> 00:04:22,240
太让人激动了
Isn't that exciting?

132
00:04:22,250 --> 00:04:23,770
周五他们要派一个小组过来
They're gonna send a whole team Friday,

133
00:04:23,770 --> 00:04:25,940
让摄影人员跟随录像
follow me around with a camera crew,

134
00:04:25,950 --> 00:04:27,620
然后在主场比赛时采访我
then interview me at the homecoming games.

135
00:04:27,620 --> 00:04:29,940
听着 我想请你帮我个大忙
So listen, I kinda have a big favor to ask.

136
00:04:29,940 --> 00:04:31,220
好吧
Uh, w--okay.

137
00:04:31,220 --> 00:04:33,220
依照传统 校队教练夫妇
Traditionally, the varsity coach and his wife

138
00:04:33,220 --> 00:04:34,840
要在主场比赛前为整支球队
cook a big pancake breakfast

139
00:04:34,840 --> 00:04:36,220
准备大型煎饼早餐会
for the football team for homecoming.

140
00:04:36,440 --> 00:04:37,780
我有不祥的预感
I do not like where this is going.

141
00:04:37,840 --> 00:04:38,620
先让我说完
Well, let me finish.

142
00:04:38,640 --> 00:04:39,540
好吧 继续
Okay, continue.

143
00:04:40,200 --> 00:04:41,400
我们一起
How would you feel

144
00:04:41,400 --> 00:04:43,320
为学校橄榄球队准备煎饼早餐会
if you and I cooked a big pancake breakfast

145
00:04:43,320 --> 00:04:44,500
你意下如何
for the varsity football team?

146
00:04:44,800 --> 00:04:46,100
你说不说完有什么区别
Did you think that that was a twist?

147
00:04:46,600 --> 00:04:47,100
米奇尔 拜托了
Mitchell, please.

148
00:04:47,220 --> 00:04:47,560
不行
No!

149
00:04:47,940 --> 00:04:50,160
除非你能说服汤姆·布拉迪来过夜
No, unless you can convince Tom Brady to spend the night,

150
00:04:50,460 --> 00:04:53,140
不然我是不会给任何橄榄球员做早餐的
I am not making breakfast for any football players.

151
00:04:53,155 --> 00:04:55,120
他是个橄榄球运动员对吧
He -- he is a football player, right?

152
00:04:55,120 --> 00:04:56,640
是的 你引用的很正确
Yes. It's the perfect reference.

153
00:04:56,720 --> 00:04:58,740
可米奇尔 这很重要
But, Mitchell, this is important.

154
00:04:58,960 --> 00:05:01,280
我的工作也很重要 周五要做结案陈词
So is my job. I have closing arguments on Friday.

155
00:05:01,280 --> 00:05:02,756
我保证你九点就可以走了
I promise you'll be out by 9:00.

156
00:05:02,756 --> 00:05:04,080
我不过想向世界展示
I just wanna show the world

157
00:05:04,080 --> 00:05:06,500
我们和异性恋夫妇一样
that we're as supportive and respectful

158
00:05:06,500 --> 00:05:07,860
支持他人又值得尊重
as any straight couple.

159
00:05:08,360 --> 00:05:10,480
你这话说得太世故了
That's an incredibly manipulative thing to say.

160
00:05:10,560 --> 00:05:11,740
我不是那个意思
Well, that's not how I meant it.

161
00:05:11,740 --> 00:05:12,880
你伤到我感情了
And that hurts my feelings.

162
00:05:12,940 --> 00:05:15,140
天啊 你这一套好烂太容易被识破了
Oh, my God. This is so lame and transparent.

163
00:05:15,260 --> 00:05:17,320
我认了 你比我聪明太多了
Busted. You know, you're so much smarter than me.

164
00:05:17,360 --> 00:05:18,780
我真想知道如何把你这股兴奋劲关掉
Oh, I wish I knew where your "off" switch was.

165
00:05:18,860 --> 00:05:20,080
你知道怎么把我的兴奋劲打开
Well, you know where my "on" switch is.

166
00:05:23,834 --> 00:05:25,700
你好 邓菲女士 还记得我吗
Hey, Mrs. Dunphy. Remember me?

167
00:05:25,700 --> 00:05:27,300
安迪 当然啦 进来吧
Andy. Of course. Come on in.

168
00:05:28,000 --> 00:05:29,680
你是乔的保姆 对吧
You are Joe's babysitter, right?

169
00:05:30,166 --> 00:05:32,300
在儿童保育界
Uh, "manny" is what we call ourselves

170
00:05:32,300 --> 00:05:33,340
我们称自己为男保姆[曼尼]
in the child care community.

171
00:05:33,380 --> 00:05:34,920
但在他们家叫这个有些乱
But it's confusing in that house

172
00:05:34,920 --> 00:05:36,280
因为他们的儿子也叫曼尼
because of their son Manny.

173
00:05:36,280 --> 00:05:39,080
所以我在试着改称"陪护哥"
So I've been trying to get traction with "bro-pair."

174
00:05:39,080 --> 00:05:39,380
安迪你好
Hey, Andy.

175
00:05:39,590 --> 00:05:41,744
你好 阁下 邓菲先生
Hey, Sir...uh, Mr. Dunphy.

176
00:05:41,744 --> 00:05:43,726
抱歉 刚没看到你
Sorry. I didn't...see you.

177
00:05:43,736 --> 00:05:46,521
安迪 邓菲阁下是我的英国名字
Andy, please. "Sir Mr. Dunphy" is my british name.

178
00:05:46,571 --> 00:05:49,114
天啊 你即兴想出来的梗吗
Oh, my... you did not just think of that!

179
00:05:49,114 --> 00:05:50,246
是啊
Yes!

180
00:05:50,767 --> 00:05:52,840
安迪 你找我们有什么事
Andy, what can we do for ya?

181
00:05:52,840 --> 00:05:53,780
我来这
I'm actually here --

182
00:05:53,800 --> 00:05:54,460
安迪 你好
Hey, Andy.

183
00:05:54,800 --> 00:05:55,100
来吧
Come on.

184
00:05:55,380 --> 00:05:56,220
他是来找你的啊
He's here for you?

185
00:05:56,360 --> 00:05:57,620
是的 我们要去地下室
Yeah. We're just gonna be in the basement.

186
00:05:58,740 --> 00:05:59,920
见到你们很高兴
So good to see you guys.

187
00:06:02,020 --> 00:06:03,660
我不知道我为什么要鞠躬
I don't know why I just did that.

188
00:06:05,164 --> 00:06:06,020
什么情况
What was that?!

189
00:06:06,020 --> 00:06:06,760
别生气
Don't be offended.

190
00:06:07,000 --> 00:06:09,540
很多国家的文化习俗是只向男性鞠躬
In many cultures, it's customary to bow only to the man.

191
00:06:09,760 --> 00:06:12,320
菲尔 海莉和安迪之间有情况吗
Phil. Haley, Andy -- is that a thing?

192
00:06:12,360 --> 00:06:13,900
我不知道
Oh. I don't know.

193
00:06:14,068 --> 00:06:15,540
希望没情况
Well, I hope not.

194
00:06:15,540 --> 00:06:18,160
海莉处在人生的低谷
Haley is at a very low point in her life.

195
00:06:18,160 --> 00:06:19,720
她现在最不需要的就是一段感情
It's the last thing she needs right now.

196
00:06:19,880 --> 00:06:22,060
不觉得有时男生会是个好影响吗
Sometimes a boy might be a good distraction?

197
00:06:22,740 --> 00:06:23,980
我还记得某位年轻小姐
I remember a certain young lady

198
00:06:23,990 --> 00:06:25,719
玩"吃豆人"玩到上瘾
was pretty addicted to "Ms. Pac-man"

199
00:06:25,719 --> 00:06:27,710
直到一位时髦的年轻男士引起了她的主意
until a dashing young gent caught her eye.

200
00:06:27,720 --> 00:06:29,540
还不是因为你戴了个羽毛耳环
Only because you were wearing a feather earring.

201
00:06:29,580 --> 00:06:30,380
那不是羽毛
It wasn't a feather.

202
00:06:31,040 --> 00:06:32,200
是捕梦网
It was a dream catcher.

203
00:06:32,960 --> 00:06:34,660
而且它起作用了
And it worked.

204
00:06:38,620 --> 00:06:39,240
课上完了
Well, we're done.

205
00:06:39,560 --> 00:06:40,540
这周再上一节
One more session this week,

206
00:06:40,540 --> 00:06:41,840
曼尼就准备好考试了
and Manny will be ready for his test.

207
00:06:41,940 --> 00:06:43,140
好的
Ay, qué bueno.

208
00:06:48,360 --> 00:06:48,460
谢谢
Gracias!

209
00:07:09,300 --> 00:07:10,080
他们在说什么
What are they saying?

210
00:07:10,620 --> 00:07:13,180
我要是知道 还要他干啥
If I knew, he wouldn't be here.

211
00:07:20,660 --> 00:07:21,140
你去哪了
Where have you been?

212
00:07:21,280 --> 00:07:23,000
我一个人在这做煎饼做了一小时
I've been cooking pancakes by myself for an hour.

213
00:07:23,260 --> 00:07:24,220
有什么我能帮上忙的吗
What can I do to help?

214
00:07:24,220 --> 00:07:25,863
你去打几个鸡蛋
Uh, you can crack some eggs over there.

215
00:07:26,600 --> 00:07:27,420
说实话
You know what?

216
00:07:27,420 --> 00:07:29,460
我觉得搅拌东西看起来好些
I think whisking might read better.

217
00:07:29,460 --> 00:07:31,240
你干什么呢 盆里什么都没有
What are you doing? There's nothing in there.

218
00:07:31,620 --> 00:07:32,840
唐 你能看出来这里没东西吗
Don, can you tell there's nothing in here?

219
00:07:33,000 --> 00:07:33,360
不能
All good.

220
00:07:33,480 --> 00:07:34,260
唐说没事
Don's all good.

221
00:07:34,420 --> 00:07:35,900
我们还要去拍点别的东西
So we're getting some extra footage.

222
00:07:36,000 --> 00:07:36,840
行话叫"幕后花絮"
What we call "b-roll."

223
00:07:37,180 --> 00:07:38,320
安妮想拍我帮忙做饭的镜头
Anne wants to see me help cook.

224
00:07:38,320 --> 00:07:39,760
我想让你帮忙做饭
I wanna see you help cook.

225
00:07:39,760 --> 00:07:41,680
我还以为这是我们两个共同完成的呢
I thought this was something that we were doing together.

226
00:07:41,680 --> 00:07:43,712
你说得对 一起来吧 抱歉
Yes, you're right. Okay, let's do this. Sorry.

227
00:07:45,520 --> 00:07:47,080
完美 我很满意
That's perfect. I'm happy.

228
00:07:47,140 --> 00:07:47,780
唐很满意
Don's happy.

229
00:07:47,940 --> 00:07:48,900
我不满意
I'm not happy.

230
00:07:49,500 --> 00:07:50,400
伙计们 吃得如何
What's up, guys!?

231
00:07:55,520 --> 00:07:57,080
普里契特先生
Ah, Senor Pritchett.

232
00:07:57,780 --> 00:07:58,780
一起来吧
Please, join us.

233
00:07:58,960 --> 00:08:01,200
感谢你请我到我自家的泳池游泳
Nice as it is for you to invite me to swim in my own pool,

234
00:08:01,500 --> 00:08:03,520
我还以为请你来是给曼尼教西班牙语的
I thought I was paying you to teach Manny Spanish.

235
00:08:03,720 --> 00:08:05,140
曼尼上完课了
Manny's done with his lesson.

236
00:08:05,140 --> 00:08:07,840
但迪亚高还是个游泳教练
But Diego here is also a swim instructor,

237
00:08:07,840 --> 00:08:09,700
他要教乔游泳
So he's going to teach Joe to swim.

238
00:08:09,740 --> 00:08:10,620
他水平一定很高
Must be a good teacher

239
00:08:10,620 --> 00:08:12,020
乔不用在场都能学会
if Joe doesn't have to be here for it.

240
00:08:12,120 --> 00:08:14,580
曼尼在给他换游泳尿布
Manny's putting him in his swimming diaper.

241
00:08:15,360 --> 00:08:16,520
他们来了
There they are!

242
00:08:17,680 --> 00:08:19,160
我们游泳吧
Let's go swim!

243
00:08:20,060 --> 00:08:20,940
到我这来
Come here.

244
00:08:24,720 --> 00:08:27,380
知道吗 自从你给我们看了那个模型
You know, after you showed us that cool model,

245
00:08:27,380 --> 00:08:30,512
我就开始仔细研究"美国宪法号"
I started reading up on the "U.S.S. Constitution."

246
00:08:30,580 --> 00:08:31,460
这船在那个年代可真具规模
Quite a ship in its day.

247
00:08:31,984 --> 00:08:34,480
当然后来人们造了蒸汽船
En, of course you invented steam ships.

248
00:08:34,480 --> 00:08:36,740
你这个老帆船护卫舰是无法
Your old sailing frigates just couldn't compete

249
00:08:36,740 --> 00:08:38,520
和那些又新又快的
with those younger, faster,

250
00:08:38,720 --> 00:08:39,980
蒸汽船模型抗衡的
steamier models in the water.

251
00:08:40,100 --> 00:08:40,900
真是太遗憾了
You know, it's too bad

252
00:08:40,900 --> 00:08:42,040
你不好好做西班牙语作业
you don't spend as much time

253
00:08:42,040 --> 00:08:44,220
却花大把时间上网
on your spanish homework as you do online

254
00:08:44,220 --> 00:08:46,060
千方百计寻找
finding passive-aggressive ways

255
00:08:46,060 --> 00:08:47,760
攻击我的兴趣爱好的方法
of using my hobbies against me.

256
00:08:48,760 --> 00:08:49,320
这是什么
What's this?

257
00:08:49,320 --> 00:08:50,380
家长批准函
Permission slip.

258
00:08:50,380 --> 00:08:52,267
让我转学法语
Lets me transfer into French.

259
00:08:52,447 --> 00:08:54,614
只需一位家长签字即可
Only one parent signature required.

260
00:08:57,600 --> 00:09:00,260
求你了 杰 我受不了了 我放弃
Come on, Jay. I can't take it anymore. I quit.

261
00:09:00,480 --> 00:09:01,960
你听起来已经像个法国人了
You're already starting to sound French.

262
00:09:06,060 --> 00:09:08,200
亲爱的 我开始担心艾丽克斯了
Honey, I'm getting worried about Alex.

263
00:09:08,260 --> 00:09:09,660
我觉得她昨晚又没睡觉
I don't think she slept again last night.

264
00:09:09,660 --> 00:09:10,760
已经连续三个晚上了
It's like the third night in a row.

265
00:09:10,880 --> 00:09:12,440
我以为你会定闹钟起来看看她的
I thought you were gonna set your alarm and check on her?

266
00:09:12,540 --> 00:09:13,800
可是那破玩意根本没响
Stupid thing never went off.

267
00:09:20,880 --> 00:09:22,520
我敢肯定艾丽克斯睡觉了
I'm sure Alex slept.

268
00:09:22,820 --> 00:09:23,240
我不知道
I don't know.

269
00:09:23,340 --> 00:09:25,140
她坐在桌子前 眼珠都懒得动一下
She's sitting at her desk, too tired to move her eyeballs.

270
00:09:25,460 --> 00:09:26,600
她是这样拿着书在看的
She's reading her book like this.

271
00:09:27,000 --> 00:09:28,720
谁看见我的豹纹裙子了
Did anyone see my leopard print skirt?

272
00:09:28,960 --> 00:09:30,520
我在楼梯上看见一条豹纹头巾
I saw a leopard headband on the stairs.

273
00:09:30,700 --> 00:09:31,360
那就是了
That's it.

274
00:09:31,360 --> 00:09:32,700
艾丽克斯没事
Alex is gonna be fine.

275
00:09:32,700 --> 00:09:33,920
这位才是我所担心的
That's the one I'm worried about.

276
00:09:33,920 --> 00:09:35,239
我要去跟她谈一谈
I'm gonna go talk to her.

277
00:09:36,100 --> 00:09:37,560
真不敢相信我把她的裙子套在头上
I can't believe I just went power-walking

278
00:09:37,560 --> 00:09:38,840
出去锻炼了
with her skirt on my head.

279
00:09:39,214 --> 00:09:41,240
海莉 亲爱的 我想跟你谈谈
Haley, honey, I wanted to talk to you

280
00:09:41,240 --> 00:09:42,540
关于你和安迪的事
about this whole thing with Andy.

281
00:09:42,540 --> 00:09:43,600
有什么可谈的
What's there to talk about?

282
00:09:43,600 --> 00:09:46,380
我担心那会使你分心
Well, I'm concerned that it is distracting you

283
00:09:46,380 --> 00:09:47,480
无暇去做真正重要的事
from what's really important.

284
00:09:47,480 --> 00:09:48,973
妈妈 你完全没必要担心
Oh, mom, there's nothing to worry about.

285
00:09:48,973 --> 00:09:51,061
我们只是肉体关系
You know, it's just sex.

286
00:09:51,600 --> 00:09:52,040
什么
What?

287
00:09:52,740 --> 00:09:54,900
纯肉体的 只是释放压力的途径而已
Purely physical. It's really just a stress-reliever.

288
00:09:56,740 --> 00:09:59,940
我根本没跟安迪上床 我们只是朋友
I am not having sex with Andy. We're just friends.

289
00:09:59,940 --> 00:10:01,660
我在帮他准备工作面试
I'm helping him prep for a job interview

290
00:10:01,660 --> 00:10:03,340
这件事他不希望别人知道
that he doesn't want anybody to know about.

291
00:10:03,760 --> 00:10:05,560
用上床这个借口
The whole sex thing was the fastest way

292
00:10:05,560 --> 00:10:07,040
是堵住我妈妈嘴的最快方法
to end the conversation with my mother.

293
00:10:07,154 --> 00:10:08,840
还有别的问题吗
Uh, are there any more questions?

294
00:10:08,840 --> 00:10:09,880
-没了 -好的
- No. - Okay, cool.

295
00:10:09,960 --> 00:10:11,620
是他来了
Oh, that's him.

296
00:10:12,567 --> 00:10:15,360
你看起来真帅啊
Hey! Oh, you look so good!

297
00:10:15,360 --> 00:10:16,860
快进来 准备好了吗
Come inside. Are you ready?

298
00:10:17,180 --> 00:10:19,020
是的 我在网上看了些东西
Yeah. I saw some stuff online,

299
00:10:19,020 --> 00:10:21,180
有些新花样我想试试
so I got a couple new things I wanna try out.

300
00:10:21,300 --> 00:10:22,480
来吧
Let's do it!

301
00:10:24,080 --> 00:10:24,940
这就证明 安妮
...which proves, Anne,

302
00:10:24,940 --> 00:10:26,800
同志教练也能带出好队伍
you can score with a gay coach.

303
00:10:27,086 --> 00:10:28,800
等等 能不能重来一遍
Wait. Uh, can I try that again?

304
00:10:28,800 --> 00:10:29,740
不用 刚才很好
No, that was great.

305
00:10:29,740 --> 00:10:32,760
你的另一半是怎么看待你做教练这件事的
Um, how does your spouse feel about you coaching?

306
00:10:32,760 --> 00:10:33,420
他吗
Oh, this one?

307
00:10:33,900 --> 00:10:36,080
他是我的动力 他是...
He's my rock. He's...

308
00:10:36,080 --> 00:10:37,381
他就是我的康妮·布里登
He's my Connie Britton.

309
00:10:37,381 --> 00:10:38,710
你的 你的康妮·布里登
Your...your Connie Britton?

310
00:10:38,710 --> 00:10:40,843
是《胜利之光》里的教练夫人
Mrs. Coach on "Friday Night Lights."

311
00:10:40,920 --> 00:10:41,880
我能跟你聊几句吗
Can I talk to you for a second?

312
00:10:42,000 --> 00:10:45,040
唐 安妮 我们能不能
Uh, Don, Anne? Can we, uh...

313
00:10:45,040 --> 00:10:45,300
当然可以
Sure.

314
00:10:45,780 --> 00:10:47,180
怎么了
Yeah, what's up?

315
00:10:47,180 --> 00:10:47,900
你有没有意识到
Do you have any idea

316
00:10:47,900 --> 00:10:49,360
这一上午你是怎么侮辱我的
how insulting you've been to me all morning?

317
00:10:49,360 --> 00:10:50,940
就因为我把你比作康妮·布里登吗
What, because I just compared you to Connie Britton?

318
00:10:50,940 --> 00:10:52,820
米奇尔 她跟泰勒教练是平等的
Mitchell, she was an equal to coach Taylor.

319
00:10:52,860 --> 00:10:54,340
你看过那部剧的话就知道了
You'd know that if you saw the show.

320
00:10:54,440 --> 00:10:55,420
我猜我没看过的原因就是
Well, I guess I missed it

321
00:10:55,420 --> 00:10:57,231
《小卡秀》总是没完没了地在播
because "The Cam show" was always on.

322
00:10:57,240 --> 00:10:59,280
真的吗 你就那么不想让我出出风头吗
Really? You're not gonna let me have my moment here?

323
00:10:59,280 --> 00:11:00,540
你总是在出风头
It is always your moment,

324
00:11:00,540 --> 00:11:02,120
通常我是不在意的
and usually I-I'm fine with that.

325
00:11:02,120 --> 00:11:03,100
但是那天晚上
But the other night,

326
00:11:03,100 --> 00:11:04,580
我试图让他们来报道我的案子
I was trying to get them to cover my case,

327
00:11:04,580 --> 00:11:06,120
而你 你却非要抢风头
and you -- you made it all about you.

328
00:11:06,120 --> 00:11:07,240
我没有 你这样说不公平
I did not. That is unfair.

329
00:11:07,380 --> 00:11:08,860
我一直都支持你的工作
I have always supported your job

330
00:11:08,860 --> 00:11:10,440
我知道你的工作有多重要
and know how important it is.

331
00:11:10,600 --> 00:11:12,360
是吗 我的新案子是什么
Really? What's my new case about?

332
00:11:12,371 --> 00:11:15,146
这三周来我一直在跟你说这一个案子
The only one I was talking about for three weeks.

333
00:11:15,640 --> 00:11:15,980
有人
People...

334
00:11:17,280 --> 00:11:18,160
需要他人支持
who need people.

335
00:11:18,300 --> 00:11:19,260
他们幸运吗 小卡
Are they lucky, Cam?

336
00:11:19,420 --> 00:11:21,300
他们是这世上最幸运的人吗
Are they the luckiest people in the world?

337
00:11:21,840 --> 00:11:23,780
二爸 她又开始哭个不停了
Daddy, she won't stop crying again.

338
00:11:23,860 --> 00:11:24,500
等一下 宝贝
One second, honey.

339
00:11:24,600 --> 00:11:26,180
小卡 我很爱你
Look, Cam, I love you very much,

340
00:11:26,180 --> 00:11:27,980
但我不喜欢你今天对待我的态度
but I resent the way you're treating me today.

341
00:11:27,980 --> 00:11:35,380
好吗 我不是什么50年代的家庭主妇
Okay, I am not some 1950s housewife. I...

342
00:11:38,480 --> 00:11:39,920
你是不是签了什么东西
Did you sign something

343
00:11:39,920 --> 00:11:41,960
同意让曼尼改学法语
so that Manny could switch to French?

344
00:11:42,120 --> 00:11:42,520
是的
I did.

345
00:11:42,740 --> 00:11:44,580
你知道我希望他学西班牙语的
You knew that I wanted him to learn Spanish.

346
00:11:44,680 --> 00:11:46,160
我也知道你不能强迫孩子
I also know you can't force a kid

347
00:11:46,160 --> 00:11:47,760
去喜欢自己不感兴趣的东西
to be interested in something that he's not.

348
00:11:47,880 --> 00:11:49,040
所以我才有一张
That's why I have a picture

349
00:11:49,040 --> 00:11:51,360
米奇尔和他的舞伴握手的照片
of Mitchell and his prom date shaking hands.

350
00:11:51,480 --> 00:11:52,920
要是你们能在意一下
It would be nice for someone to care

351
00:11:52,920 --> 00:11:54,040
我的感受就好了
what I think for a change.

352
00:11:54,100 --> 00:11:56,760
还有件事 我请了个新的游泳教练
You should also know that I hired a new swimming instructor.

353
00:11:56,780 --> 00:11:57,620
不过别担心
But don't worry.

354
00:11:57,720 --> 00:12:00,300
她也有宽阔的肩膀和小胡子
She's got the same broad shoulders plus a mustache.

355
00:12:00,440 --> 00:12:02,200
这些都是因为你嫉妒吗
So all this is because you're jealous?

356
00:12:03,080 --> 00:12:05,300
真不敢相信你居然这么...
I can't believe that you're being so...

357
00:12:05,307 --> 00:12:06,597
自...
in...fer...ur--

358
00:12:06,900 --> 00:12:08,420
那个词是什么来着
What is the word?

359
00:12:08,431 --> 00:12:10,140
-自私 顽固 -真的吗
- Selfish. Pigheaded. - Really?

360
00:12:10,140 --> 00:12:11,320
她说的 不是我
Her words, not mine.

361
00:12:11,340 --> 00:12:12,820
你知不知道说每句话之前都要
Do you know how frustrating it is

362
00:12:16,280 --> 00:12:17,980
别人当着面笑话我
To have people laugh in my face

363
00:12:17,980 --> 00:12:19,880
就因为我想不出来某个词
because I'm struggling to find the words?

364
00:12:20,340 --> 00:12:22,740
你应该穿我的鞋说一段
You should try talking in my shoes for one mile!

365
00:12:22,880 --> 00:12:23,520
我想你的意思是
I think you meant --

366
00:12:23,520 --> 00:12:25,060
我知道我的意思是什么
I know what I meant to mean.

367
00:12:25,820 --> 00:12:27,720
你知道我说西语的时候有多睿智吗
Do you even know how smart I am in Spanish?

368
00:12:27,720 --> 00:12:29,440
你当然不知道
Of course you don't.

369
00:12:30,420 --> 00:12:32,700
哪怕只有一次 我想在自己家里
For once, it would be nice to speak to someone

370
00:12:32,700 --> 00:12:35,120
讲一回自己的语言
in my own language in my own home.

371
00:12:39,060 --> 00:12:40,200
不管用西语该怎么说
Whatever the Spanish word

372
00:12:40,200 --> 00:12:41,580
但你想说的也是"女人呐"对吧
is for "women," Am I right?

373
00:12:43,357 --> 00:12:45,560
-我的妈呀 -天啊
- Mother nature! - Cheez-its!

374
00:12:46,040 --> 00:12:47,780
安迪 我不知道你在那里
Andy. I did not know you were there.

375
00:12:47,940 --> 00:12:50,580
抱歉 我走路声音太小了
Sorry. Stupid little cat feet.

376
00:12:50,820 --> 00:12:52,140
我不知道海莉在哪
I'm not sure where Haley is.

377
00:12:52,740 --> 00:12:55,860
其实 邓菲先生 我有话想跟您说
Actually, Mr. Dunphy, I was hoping I could speak with you.

378
00:12:56,127 --> 00:12:58,789
是吗 我有什么能帮你的
Oh, yeah? What can I do for ya?

379
00:13:01,206 --> 00:13:02,666
邓菲先生
Mr. Dunphy,

380
00:13:03,100 --> 00:13:05,040
我喜欢当男保姆
I love being a manny,

381
00:13:05,040 --> 00:13:06,180
但我不可能永远做这个
but I can't do it forever.

382
00:13:06,500 --> 00:13:08,560
我只是不知道下一步该怎么走
I just didn't know what the next chapter should be,

383
00:13:08,560 --> 00:13:12,280
直到我遇见了一个叫菲尔·邓菲的人
but then I met a guy named Phil Dunphy.

384
00:13:12,280 --> 00:13:14,540
-是吗 -他热爱自己的事业
- What? - A guy who loves what he does, and...

385
00:13:14,540 --> 00:13:16,540
他为自己的家庭提供了这么好的条件
Yeah. A guy who provided all this for his family.

386
00:13:16,620 --> 00:13:18,080
于是我意识到
And then I realized,

387
00:13:18,080 --> 00:13:20,760
我想要投身房地产业
a career in real estate is what I want.

388
00:13:20,780 --> 00:13:22,560
我希望自己能够
And I was hoping I could...

389
00:13:22,560 --> 00:13:24,280
向最优秀的人学习
learn from the best.

390
00:13:24,280 --> 00:13:25,173
斯基普·乌斯纳姆吗
Skip woosnum?

391
00:13:25,173 --> 00:13:26,627
我可以帮你打个电话
Um, I can put in a call.

392
00:13:26,636 --> 00:13:28,080
-他一般不回电话 -不
- He doesn't really get back -- - No.

393
00:13:28,660 --> 00:13:29,220
是你
You.

394
00:13:30,231 --> 00:13:31,898
安迪 我受宠若惊
Andy, I'm -- I'm so flattered.

395
00:13:31,898 --> 00:13:32,980
我
I'm, uh,

396
00:13:32,980 --> 00:13:35,900
可我现在不需要助手
I'm just not in the market for an assistant right now.

397
00:13:36,960 --> 00:13:37,460
是啊
Yeah.

398
00:13:38,680 --> 00:13:40,600
是我太蠢了 居然跑来这样问你
Stupid. That was stupid to even ask.

399
00:13:41,500 --> 00:13:43,060
很感谢你花时间听我说
Thank you so much for your time.

400
00:13:44,680 --> 00:13:47,860
第一课 永远不要接受"不"这个答案
Lesson number one -- never take "No" for an answer!

401
00:13:49,280 --> 00:13:50,680
向我推销你自己
Now make me buy you.

402
00:13:51,800 --> 00:13:52,320
好吧
Okay.

403
00:13:52,320 --> 00:13:55,680
我很努力工作 我很爱干净
Uh, I'm a hard worker, I am very clean,

404
00:13:55,680 --> 00:13:56,440
我很殷勤
I am eager to please,

405
00:13:56,700 --> 00:13:58,160
我上厕所超快
I take super quick bathroom breaks,

406
00:13:58,160 --> 00:13:59,880
而且我永远也不会
and I will never, ever...

407
00:14:00,920 --> 00:14:02,300
我词穷了
Oh! I'm blanking on the verb!

408
00:14:02,310 --> 00:14:04,340
要停止做某事怎么说来着
W-uh... when you give up on something?

409
00:14:04,340 --> 00:14:04,620
半途而废
Quit?

410
00:14:05,220 --> 00:14:05,960
我必须要问你
I had to ask

411
00:14:05,960 --> 00:14:07,620
是因为我根本不知道那个词的意思
because I don't know the meaning of the word.

412
00:14:08,100 --> 00:14:08,500
太棒了
Nice!

413
00:14:09,300 --> 00:14:10,260
这里什么情况
What's going on here?

414
00:14:10,420 --> 00:14:12,560
介绍一下我的新助手
I'm introducing you to my new assistant.

415
00:14:13,640 --> 00:14:14,540
我的肋骨
Oh, my ribs!

416
00:14:14,540 --> 00:14:17,180
邓菲先生 太感谢你了
Mr. Dunphy, thank you so much.

417
00:14:17,180 --> 00:14:18,380
我不会让你失望的
I will not disappoint you.

418
00:14:18,540 --> 00:14:20,280
安迪 你觉得这是个好主意吗
Andy, do you think this is a great idea,

419
00:14:20,280 --> 00:14:22,280
毕竟你和海莉在...
considering that you and Haley are...

420
00:14:22,800 --> 00:14:24,400
你知道的
You know.

421
00:14:24,740 --> 00:14:25,480
做那种事
Doing it.

422
00:14:25,480 --> 00:14:28,115
-我的妈呀 -天啊
- Mother nature! - Cheez-its!

423
00:14:28,438 --> 00:14:29,980
不 我们只是互相帮助
No.We were just helping each other

424
00:14:29,980 --> 00:14:31,120
准备工作面试
get ready for job interviews.

425
00:14:31,340 --> 00:14:33,440
我和您女儿之间没有任何
There is nothing inappropriate happening

426
00:14:33,440 --> 00:14:34,320
不正当关系
between me and your daughter.

427
00:14:34,400 --> 00:14:35,600
海莉要去参加面试吗
Haley has a job interview?

428
00:14:35,780 --> 00:14:36,820
她正在面着呢
That's where she is right now.

429
00:14:36,820 --> 00:14:37,380
跟谁面试
With who?

430
00:14:38,820 --> 00:14:39,860
加文·辛克莱
Gavin Sinclair.

431
00:14:41,300 --> 00:14:43,220
超有名的明星造型师
The big-time stylist to the stars?

432
00:14:44,600 --> 00:14:45,840
就是掌掴了播报员凯蒂·库瑞克的那个人
He's the one that slapped Katie Couric.

433
00:14:46,932 --> 00:14:49,775
我们的小女孩终于长大了
Our little girl's gonna be okay after all!

434
00:14:49,775 --> 00:14:51,020
我怎么跟你说的
All right! What'd I tell ya?

435
00:14:51,020 --> 00:14:53,340
我们的女儿是个斗士
One thing about our girl -- she's a fighter.

436
00:14:53,680 --> 00:14:56,180
你好 我跟加文·辛克莱有约
Hello. I have an appointment to see Gavin Sinclair.

437
00:14:56,420 --> 00:14:57,940
今天不行 他大姨夫来了
Not today. He's in a mood.

438
00:14:57,940 --> 00:14:58,619
好哒
'kay!

439
00:15:02,980 --> 00:15:05,740
煎饼早餐会之后我感觉很不好
I felt awful after that pancake breakfast,

440
00:15:05,740 --> 00:15:07,720
不只是因为米奇尔没把培根煎熟
and not just because Mitchell undercooked the bacon.

441
00:15:08,100 --> 00:15:10,540
我不喜欢自己对他的案子一无所知
I hated that I didn't know what his case was about.

442
00:15:10,680 --> 00:15:12,940
所以我去比赛的路上顺道去了法庭
So I popped by the courtroom on the way to the game.

443
00:15:13,320 --> 00:15:16,320
这些人靠吸穷人的血为生
These people preyed on the poorest members of society --

444
00:15:16,320 --> 00:15:19,120
那些没有能力自我辩护的人
Those who are unable to defend themselves.

445
00:15:19,120 --> 00:15:20,580
他们不受尊重
They were treated with disrespect.

446
00:15:20,980 --> 00:15:22,560
他太棒了
He was amazing!

447
00:15:22,780 --> 00:15:24,780
他做这一切都不是为了他自己
And he wasn't doing any of it for himself.

448
00:15:24,900 --> 00:15:26,800
他在帮助那些需要帮助的人
He was just trying to help those in need.

449
00:15:26,980 --> 00:15:29,900
你能想象自己被剥夺了最基本的权利以及
Can you imagine being robbed of your basic rights

450
00:15:29,900 --> 00:15:31,040
用于糊口的工资吗
and a living wage?

451
00:15:31,220 --> 00:15:33,640
这么多年来米奇尔总是全力支持我
And after all those years of Mitchell supporting me,

452
00:15:33,640 --> 00:15:35,700
我很高兴看到他成为人群焦点
I was so happy to see all eyes on him.

453
00:15:35,880 --> 00:15:37,020
这是属于他的时刻
It was his moment.

454
00:15:37,800 --> 00:15:38,960
这是如此不公
It's unfathomable.

455
00:15:39,960 --> 00:15:41,220
而这个案子...
But what this case...

456
00:15:41,220 --> 00:15:42,680
正如我所说
As I was saying,

457
00:15:42,920 --> 00:15:45,240
这个案子事关尊严
what this case is about is dignity --

458
00:15:45,420 --> 00:15:46,900
那些尊严...
the dignity of those...

459
00:15:50,500 --> 00:15:52,160
我们需要接纳这些人
And we need to take these people

460
00:15:52,260 --> 00:15:53,560
偿还他们
and we need to get them back...

461
00:15:57,660 --> 00:15:59,960
很抱歉我没跟你说就让曼尼
Listen, I'm sorry I let Manny switch over to French

462
00:15:59,960 --> 00:16:00,920
去学法语了
without consulting you.

463
00:16:01,060 --> 00:16:02,740
我没有考虑过你一直得说英文
I didn't think how it must be for you

464
00:16:02,740 --> 00:16:04,320
是种什么感受
having to speak English all the time.

465
00:16:04,460 --> 00:16:05,360
你根本不懂
You have no idea.

466
00:16:05,600 --> 00:16:07,960
我只是想告诉你我把家教请回来了
Anyway, I just wanted to tell you I hired the tutor back.

467
00:16:08,280 --> 00:16:09,680
曼尼会不高兴的
Manny's not gonna like that.

468
00:16:09,720 --> 00:16:11,240
他太沉迷于法语了
He's too much into his French thing.

469
00:16:11,400 --> 00:16:14,440
家教不是给曼尼请的 是给我自己
The tutor's not for Manny. It's for me.

470
00:16:24,200 --> 00:16:25,980
杰 我好开心
Ay, Jay, I love it!

471
00:16:25,980 --> 00:16:28,380
现在换你听起来傻乎乎的了
Now you sound like the stupid one!

472
00:16:30,840 --> 00:16:32,140
是我 我回来了
It's me. I'm back.

473
00:16:32,380 --> 00:16:32,700
为什么
Why?

474
00:16:33,020 --> 00:16:34,300
我跟一个朋友约好了
I made a pact with a friend of mine,

475
00:16:34,300 --> 00:16:35,480
不见到加文·辛克莱
and I am not leaving this office

476
00:16:35,480 --> 00:16:37,100
我就不走了
until I meet with Gavin Sinclair.

477
00:16:37,320 --> 00:16:39,160
我不管你有多么宏伟的梦想
I don't care what's on your vision board.

478
00:16:39,160 --> 00:16:40,280
你不能进去
You're not getting in there.

479
00:16:40,280 --> 00:16:41,640
所以请你...
So if you could just...

480
00:16:41,640 --> 00:16:42,880
我要忙疯了
I'm insanely busy.

481
00:16:43,180 --> 00:16:44,580
妮基 谢天谢地你在这
Nikki, thank God you're here.

482
00:16:45,040 --> 00:16:45,740
帮我剥橙子皮
Peel this orange for me.

483
00:16:45,740 --> 00:16:47,580
辛克莱先生 我是海莉·邓菲
Mr. Sinclair, it's Haley Dunphy.

484
00:16:47,580 --> 00:16:49,360
我是来面试助手职位的
I was supposed to see you for the assistant job.

485
00:16:49,480 --> 00:16:50,580
我学习了您的作品
I have been studying your work,

486
00:16:50,580 --> 00:16:51,320
不得不说
and I have to say

487
00:16:51,320 --> 00:16:52,820
你为纽约时装周设计的作品
the looks that you did for New York fashion week

488
00:16:52,820 --> 00:16:55,734
-让您... -我现在太忙了
- put you -- - Ah! I'm really too busy right now.

489
00:16:56,080 --> 00:16:58,240
但我大老远开过来
But I drove all the way down here.

490
00:16:58,240 --> 00:16:59,120
我们约好了的
We had an appointment!

491
00:16:59,200 --> 00:17:00,400
是没错 但我查看了你的博客
Yeah, I looked at your blog.

492
00:17:00,420 --> 00:17:01,860
对我来说有点太故意卖萌了
It's a little too cutesy for me.

493
00:17:01,880 --> 00:17:03,080
我需要一个犀利的人
I need someone with edge.

494
00:17:03,300 --> 00:17:04,140
我很犀利啊
I have edge.

495
00:17:04,260 --> 00:17:05,100
你真没有那种劲儿
You really don't.

496
00:17:05,580 --> 00:17:07,880
你是我见过的眼睛最大的人[天真无知]
You are literally the most wide-eyed person I've ever seen.

497
00:17:07,980 --> 00:17:09,900
你的脸跟卡通小羊羔形象一样
You have the face of a cartoon lamb.

498
00:17:09,911 --> 00:17:11,455
不过还是谢谢你能过来一趟
Thanks for coming by, though.

499
00:17:12,600 --> 00:17:14,420
那是什么玩意儿 我想要的是皮
What is that? I wanted the peel.

500
00:17:18,420 --> 00:17:20,300
我觉得你不喜欢卖萌这点真的很奇怪
I think it's weird you don't like cutesy

501
00:17:20,300 --> 00:17:22,240
因为你旗下一半出席格莱美奖的客户
Considering half your clients at the grammys looked like

502
00:17:22,240 --> 00:17:24,440
看上去像是刚从我的幼稚痴梦里走出来的
they just stepped out of a my little pony fever dream.

503
00:17:24,640 --> 00:17:26,300
说得好 但不准抨击我
That's good. But not at me.

504
00:17:26,440 --> 00:17:27,200
永远不准抨击我
Never at me.

505
00:17:27,800 --> 00:17:28,440
妮基 站住
Nikki, stop.

506
00:17:29,160 --> 00:17:30,920
妮基的服饰有5处明显的不当
There are five things wrong with Nikki's outfit.

507
00:17:31,000 --> 00:17:31,580
请问分别是什么
What are they?

508
00:17:31,676 --> 00:17:34,443
她就站在那儿呢
Uh, she's standing right there.

509
00:17:34,497 --> 00:17:36,729
我可比她打扮得好多了
I'm dressed better than she is.

510
00:17:37,167 --> 00:17:38,460
那件背心让你显得像是"独乳兽"
The tank gives you a uniboob.

511
00:17:38,460 --> 00:17:39,240
你的手表太大了
The watch is too big.

512
00:17:39,240 --> 00:17:40,740
哈伦裤 坡跟靴 别逗了
The harem pants, the wedge boots,

513
00:17:40,740 --> 00:17:41,700
那皮带是要闹哪样
and come on, that belt?

514
00:17:41,840 --> 00:17:43,200
90年代风情都已经过时3年了
The '90s have been out for three years.

515
00:17:43,320 --> 00:17:44,280
已经5处了
And that's five.

516
00:17:45,140 --> 00:17:46,240
需要我来点评一下你吗
Now should I do you?

517
00:17:54,183 --> 00:17:55,822
胜利 太漂亮啦[法语]
Victoire! C'est magnifique!

518
00:17:55,832 --> 00:17:57,320
打扰一下 小少年
Uh, excuse me, young man.

519
00:17:57,320 --> 00:17:58,680
是塔克教练公开性取向
Was it coach Tucker's openness

520
00:17:58,680 --> 00:18:00,340
给了你出柜的勇气吗
that gave you the courage to come out?

521
00:18:00,340 --> 00:18:01,417
什么
What?

522
00:18:04,362 --> 00:18:05,749
-你也来啦 -过来
- Hey, you! - Come here.

523
00:18:05,749 --> 00:18:06,574
法院那边耽搁了一下
Court ran a little late,

524
00:18:06,574 --> 00:18:07,640
但我还是看到你们获胜了
but I got to see you win.

525
00:18:07,640 --> 00:18:08,740
-恭喜啊 -谢谢
- Congratulations. - Thank you!

526
00:18:08,760 --> 00:18:09,460
你是化妆了吗
Are you wearing makeup?

527
00:18:09,740 --> 00:18:10,740
就脸上抹了一点
Oh, well, just on my face

528
00:18:10,740 --> 00:18:12,180
以及耳朵 脖子和手 没错
And my ears and my neck and my hands, yeah.

529
00:18:12,180 --> 00:18:13,502
听着 关于今天早上的事...
Okay, so listen. About this morning --

530
00:18:13,512 --> 00:18:15,080
塔克教练 塔克教练
Uh, coach Tucker, coach Tucker.

531
00:18:15,080 --> 00:18:16,680
能请你就这次的大胜利发表一下感言吗
Can we get a few words on your big win?

532
00:18:16,680 --> 00:18:18,545
我得 接受一下采访
Oh, um, I-I need to do this.

533
00:18:18,554 --> 00:18:20,100
好的 当然了 没事
Yeah. Of course you do. Yeah, it's fine.

534
00:18:20,100 --> 00:18:21,300
跟我说说 教练
So tell me, coach,

535
00:18:21,300 --> 00:18:22,700
这次胜利是什么感觉
how does this victory feel?

536
00:18:22,860 --> 00:18:23,760
感觉棒极了
Well, it feels great.

537
00:18:23,860 --> 00:18:25,740
显然 我感觉就像橄榄球女王一样
Obviously, I feel like the belle of the football.

538
00:18:26,162 --> 00:18:27,723
唐喜欢这个笑话 唐在笑呢
Don liked that one. Don's laughing.

539
00:18:30,275 --> 00:18:32,100
我很感激学校的支持
Well, I'm grateful to this school, you know,

540
00:18:32,100 --> 00:18:33,380
以及孩子们和家长们
and the kids and the parents.

541
00:18:33,380 --> 00:18:36,217
但是 我必须说 我最感激的...
But, um, you know, I gotta say, I'm most grateful for --

542
00:18:36,240 --> 00:18:38,680
是这边这位 也就是我丈夫
for this guy right here, my husband.

543
00:18:38,689 --> 00:18:40,440
米奇尔 米奇尔·普里契特
Uh, Mitchell. Mitchell Pritchett.

544
00:18:41,660 --> 00:18:42,340
他是个律师
He's an attorney

545
00:18:42,340 --> 00:18:44,180
专为那些默默无闻的弱势群体发声
who is the voice for people without one.

546
00:18:44,180 --> 00:18:45,960
他是个真英雄
He is a-a real hero...

547
00:18:45,960 --> 00:18:47,460
但却没有受到应得的赞美和赏识
who doesn't get the credit he deserves.

548
00:18:48,280 --> 00:18:50,480
今天 我特意赶去法庭欣赏他的雄姿
Today, I went down and I watched him in the courtroom.

549
00:18:50,680 --> 00:18:51,420
我就知道那人是你
I knew that was you.

550
00:18:51,420 --> 00:18:52,490
我听出你的手机铃声了
I recognized your ringtone.

551
00:18:52,490 --> 00:18:53,715
我正在蓄势待发呢
I'm building to something.

552
00:18:54,380 --> 00:18:56,480
虽然 我获得了很多关注
You know, yeah, I get a lot of attention,

553
00:18:56,480 --> 00:18:57,880
就是 指导这次比赛
you know, coaching this game.

554
00:18:57,880 --> 00:19:00,320
但站在我身边的这位男人
But this man right here

555
00:19:00,320 --> 00:19:01,740
默默地维护着
quietly defends the rights

556
00:19:01,740 --> 00:19:03,700
那些困难群体的权利
of real people with real problems.

557
00:19:04,480 --> 00:19:07,080
无家可归的人 被迫去找工作
Homeless people forced to get jobs.

558
00:19:07,080 --> 00:19:08,280
不 不是这么回事
No, that's not it.

559
00:19:08,280 --> 00:19:09,580
就相差那么一点点了
That's not it, but it was so close.

560
00:19:09,580 --> 00:19:12,579
是的 我站在这里
Yes, I am standing here

561
00:19:12,820 --> 00:19:15,920
勇敢地废止人们对同性恋的固有印象
boldly abolishing gay stereotypes.

562
00:19:16,360 --> 00:19:16,640
但是...
But...

563
00:19:16,640 --> 00:19:19,000
我的妆都花了 对吧
My makeup's running, isn't it?

564
00:19:22,023 --> 00:19:23,990
我做到了 我得到那份工作了
I did it! I got the job!

565
00:19:24,081 --> 00:19:24,974
真的吗
Really?

566
00:19:24,974 --> 00:19:26,820
-亲爱的 我好为你骄傲 -谢谢
- Honey, I'm so proud! - Thank you!

567
00:19:26,820 --> 00:19:27,880
我从未怀疑过你
Never doubted you.

568
00:19:27,880 --> 00:19:28,709
太棒了 太棒了
So great. So great.

569
00:19:28,709 --> 00:19:29,509
亲爱的
Sweetheart!

570
00:19:29,509 --> 00:19:31,700
是啊 整个过程 跟坐过山车一样跌宕起伏
I know! It was such a roller coaster!

571
00:19:31,700 --> 00:19:33,240
那个前台接待太刻薄了
The receptionist was so mean,

572
00:19:33,240 --> 00:19:34,580
我就躲在车里哭了一阵
and I went and I cried in my car.

573
00:19:34,580 --> 00:19:35,880
我当时都打算离开了
And I was about to leave,

574
00:19:35,880 --> 00:19:36,580
但我突然想起来
but I remembered

575
00:19:36,580 --> 00:19:38,520
你跟我爸谈的时候有多勇敢
how brave you were talking to my dad,

576
00:19:38,520 --> 00:19:39,900
所以我又重新走进去了
so I got back in there!

577
00:19:40,020 --> 00:19:42,240
我也按照你说的坚持忍住了没吐
And I did that thing you said about not throwing up.

578
00:19:42,340 --> 00:19:43,200
天啊
Oh, my god.

579
00:19:43,200 --> 00:19:45,700
我看某些男孩真的是有积极影响力的
I guess some boys are a good distraction.

580
00:19:45,700 --> 00:19:47,820
是啊 他正是她现在所需要的
Yeah, he could be exactly what she needs right now.

581
00:19:47,820 --> 00:19:48,900
我不知道你是怎么看的
And I don't know about you,

582
00:19:48,900 --> 00:19:50,360
但我感觉到他们之间有点小火花
but I'm sensing a little heat over here.

583
00:19:50,560 --> 00:19:52,140
天啊 我真为你高兴
Oh, my god! I'm so happy for you!

584
00:19:52,140 --> 00:19:53,486
真的太棒了
Oh, this is so great.

585
00:19:53,486 --> 00:19:54,980
谢谢你 邓菲先生
And thanks to you, Mr. Dunphy,

586
00:19:54,980 --> 00:19:57,480
我终于可以省钱为贝丝买订婚戒指了
I can finally save up and get Beth that engagement ring.

587
00:19:57,740 --> 00:19:58,440
贝丝是谁
Who's Beth?

588
00:19:58,680 --> 00:19:59,440
他女朋友
His girlfriend.

589
00:20:00,200 --> 00:20:01,460
所以你们两个并没有在一起吗
So you two really aren't together?

590
00:20:01,520 --> 00:20:02,260
-没有 -没有
- No. - No.

591
00:20:02,489 --> 00:20:04,557
她真的好痴迷于我们是一对啊
She's, like, really obsessed with us.

592
00:20:07,420 --> 00:20:07,820
克莱尔
Claire?

593
00:20:08,540 --> 00:20:09,940
书上的文字都好像在震动一样
The words on the page are vibrating,

594
00:20:09,940 --> 00:20:10,980
我无法让它们停下来
and I can't make them stop.

595
00:20:11,000 --> 00:20:11,980
我不知道怎么看书了
I forgot how to read!

596
00:20:12,120 --> 00:20:13,560
艾丽克斯 天啊
Alex, oh, my god.

597
00:20:14,020 --> 00:20:14,860
读给我听吧 妈咪
Read it to me, mommy?

598
00:20:15,760 --> 00:20:16,860
宝贝 你精疲力尽了
Baby, you're exhausted

599
00:20:16,860 --> 00:20:18,260
你得立刻去睡觉
and you need to go to sleep right now.

600
00:20:18,260 --> 00:20:19,020
跟我来 跟我来
Come with me. Come with me.

601
00:20:19,440 --> 00:20:22,600
好吧 你的一切看法都是错的
Yes, you were wrong about everything!

602
00:20:27,224 --> 00:20:28,235
"好哒"
"'kay"?

603
00:20:28,235 --> 00:20:29,380
谁会说"好哒"啊
Who says "'kay"?!

604
00:20:29,380 --> 00:20:30,550
你真是蠢得要死
You're so stupid!

605
00:20:34,000 --> 00:20:35,980
走开 绕过去
Go! Go around!
